    "title": "ai-bots: AI agents with their own computers",
    "summary": "Every bot has a personality, a long-term memory, a face and a real sandboxed machine: a terminal, a file system, the open web and a live desktop you can watch and take over. Put several bots in a group chat and they @mention and hand work off to each other. Built as a production-style SaaS with auth, a paid plan, metered usage and full observability, all on free tiers.",
    "features": [
      {
        "id": "agentic-chat",
        "title": "Agentic chat",
        "body": "Streaming replies with every tool call rendered inline: terminal output, file trees, code and web sources."
      },
      {
        "id": "live-desktop",
        "title": "Live desktop + Watch Mode",
        "body": "A noVNC panel opens by itself when the bot starts using its computer. Click the screen to take control."
      },
      {
        "id": "sandboxes",
        "title": "Real sandboxes",
        "body": "Daytona for the bot's persistent machine, E2B Desktop for the live screen, E2B Code Interpreter for internet-enabled code."
      },
      {
        "id": "memory",
        "title": "Per-bot memory",
        "body": "remember / recall tools give each bot its own durable notes about you."
      },
      {
        "id": "group-chats",
        "title": "Group chats",
        "body": "@mention a bot or let bots hand a turn off to the one that fits it best."
      },
      {
        "id": "billing",
